  "question": "A cylinder contains hydrogen gas at pressure of $249$ kPa and temperature $27°$C. Its density is : ($R = 8.3\\ \\text{J mol}^{-1}\\text{K}^{-1}$)",
  "diagram": "",
  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [
